  "title": "Strawberry Crumble Bars",
  "description": "This easy strawberry crumble bar recipe features sliced strawberries sandwiched between a bottom crust and a top crumble layer for a tasty summer treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Rebecca Bekki Rodriguez"
  ],
